l,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"671758364879883737","clanid":"46550996","posterid":"0","headline":"Jigsaw Puzzles Complete is OUT NOW!","posttime":1793722146,"updatetime":1793722146,"body":"[p]Hi everyone![\/p][p]Jigsaw Puzzles Complete is out now on Steam, and I want to say a huge thank you to everyone who has picked it up, shared a screenshot, reported a problem, or sent me an idea.[\/p][p]Since launching on 27 October, I\u2019ve already received tons of feedback, and I\u2019ve been making changes based on it. Your suggestions are helping shape the game, one piece at a time.[\/p][p]Here are some of the improvements made since launch:[\/p][list][*][p][b]Make the table your own:[\/b] a movable, resizable reference picture, manual sorting trays, and saved Zen puzzle settings.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]More room to change your mind:[\/b] expanded Undo and Redo in solo Zen, including moves, rotations, joins, and placements.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Keep unfinished puzzles organized:[\/b] name, search, archive, and restore saved puzzles, with previews showing your actual arrangements.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Play more comfortably:[\/b] customizable keyboard and controller puzzle controls, two-finger pan and zoom, and optional stronger piece outlines.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Enjoy your photo collection:[\/b] better photo management, faster Gallery and picture loading, and per-picture completion history.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]A smoother experience:[\/b] improved save recovery, co-op reconnection, translations, and an optional practice puzzle.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]Please keep the feedback coming! Tell me what you love, what feels awkward, and what you\u2019d like to see changed.[\/p][p][b]This is as much your game as mine, and I want to keep making it better with you.[\/b][\/p][p]Thank you for being part of it. Happy puzzling![\/p][p]Pinch Games[\/p]","commentcount":0,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1691520782_1793723179_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"562546671964145961","event_gid":"671758364879883736","voteupcount":0,"votedowncount":1,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"562546671964145961","rtime32_last_modified":1793947069,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793723180,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793722139,"votes_up":0,"votes_down":1,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"562546671964145960","gidfeature2":"562546671964145961"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["671758364879883737"],"last_update_event":[]}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >Choose a picture. Keep a moment.</h2>A bookshop beside a canal. A favorite painting. A photo that brings someone to mind. Settle into Jigsaw Puzzles Complete and watch a picture come together, one satisfying connection at a time.<h2 class="bb_tag" >Small journeys, one puzzle at a time</h2>Fill six-picture albums with finished puzzles. Spend an autumn day by the canal with Noor, a bookseller who notices the little things, or explore collections of waterside cities and art. Each page has a short, optional note; finishing an album unlocks a tabletop color. Prefer to choose your own path? Every album picture is also available to puzzle separately.<br><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354390/extras/73002b2b69c32c20810b8856bfb3d72d.avif?t=1793993050" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354390/extras_big/73002b2b69c32c20810b8856bfb3d72d.webp?t=1793993050 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >Your picture, your pace</h2>Choose from over 450 pictures, including paintings, nature, travel and cozy illustrations. Set your puzzle anywhere from 9 to 10,000 pieces, with optional rotation. Relax in Zen, pause when you need to, and return to your saved puzzle. You can use the usual puzzle aids and smaller piece counts while collecting album pages.<br><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354390/extras/02e2115f6d76cf7a8100e0e2473be312.avif?t=1793993050" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354390/extras_big/02e2115f6d76cf7a8100e0e2473be312.avif?t=1793993050 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >Make room for your own memories</h2>Turn your own photos into puzzles and choose their framing. Save favorites, revisit finished pictures in your Gallery, and keep your imported pictures together in a personal photo book.<h2 class="bb_tag" >A comfortable place to puzzle</h2>Sort pieces into trays, arrange them by color or shape, and focus on the edges when you want a starting point. Zoom in or consult the reference picture. Play with a mouse, controller or touch, and adjust text size, motion and sound.<br><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354390/extras/20bcd4ddfcc95a3483b8719baae2ad92.avif?t=1793993050" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354390/extras_big/20bcd4ddfcc95a3483b8719baae2ad92.avif?t=1793993050 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >A picture to build together</h2>Invite friends to a private Steam room for 2–4 players and work on the same puzzle. Choose Zen for a relaxed session or Speed for a timed challenge. Online co-op requires Steam and an internet connection.<h2 class="bb_tag" >A puzzle corner on your Windows desktop</h2>Desktop companion mode places puzzle pieces over your Windows desktop. Move and resize the puzzle frame, spread loose pieces and connected groups around your screen, and click through empty space to other apps. Floating controls let you hide the pieces, adjust their visibility, bring out more from the supply or return to the normal puzzle. Your arrangement is saved.<h2 class="bb_tag" >A different rhythm when you want it</h2>Try a Daily puzzle, explore art in Through the Ages, or chase a personal best in Speed with Steam leaderboards. The solo league offers timed races against simulated rivals whose pace is based on your previous results. These are optional ways to play; an unhurried puzzle is always there when you want one.						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					I have used Claude Code to create the game itself code and assets. 				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse sys_req" style="max-height: 300px;">
		<h2>System Requirements</h2>
				<div class="sysreq_contents">
							<div class="game_area_sys_req sysreq_content active" data-os="win">
											<div class="game_area_sys_req_leftCol">
							<ul>
								<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit dual-core processor with SSE4.2 support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with full Vulkan 1.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Internet required for online features. Solo puzzles work offline.</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
																<div class="game_area_sys_req_rightCol">
							<ul>
								<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit quad-core processor with SSE4.2 support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card with full Vulkan 1.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Internet required for online features. Solo puzzles work offline.</li></ul>							</ul>
